{"_id":"69690fd9f87102127f39864b","title":"Auto Atm","game":{"_id":"693f07d79be37dfffd87b71c","gameId":104841616983113,"name":"San Aurie","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a6a6cf88db9690c7567d028c0ef15ea275008f3fc3202e78d2be7640addbb47.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ecbd6080269181acff632109af92840/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"104841616983113-san-aurie","path":"/game/104841616983113-san-aurie","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6a6a6cf88db9690c7567d028c0ef15ea275008f3fc3202e78d2be7640addbb47.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ecbd6080269181acff632109af92840/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":104841616983113},"slug":"San-Aurie-Auto-Atm-86134","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":5237,"executes":7770,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/75f4a84e4bb26dd3fd78fd914c2cf936ad92b294b5b3db65c19f9e7247d0a23f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/104841616983113-1768493017390.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/104841616983113-1768493017390.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/75f4a84e4bb26dd3fd78fd914c2cf936ad92b294b5b3db65c19f9e7247d0a23f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/104841616983113-1768493017390.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/104841616983113-1768493017390.webp"},"likeCount":8,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-01-15T16:03:37.415Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-15T16:03:37.415Z","lastBump":"2026-01-15T16:03:37.415Z","script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal VirtualInputManager = game:GetService(\"VirtualInputManager\")\n\nlocal Player = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal AtmGui = Player.PlayerGui.ScreenGui.Center.Middle.HackingMinigames[\"ATM Hack\"]\nlocal BlockedColor = Color3.fromRGB(74, 75, 93)\n\nlocal ClickedButtons = {}\n\nlocal function GetCodes()\n    local Codes = {}\n    for Code in string.gmatch(AtmGui.Sequence1.Text, \"([^%s]+)\") do\n        table.insert(Codes, Code)\n    end\n    return Codes\nend\n\nlocal function ClickButton(Button)\n    local Pos = Button.AbsolutePosition\n    local Size = Button.AbsoluteSize\n    local X = Pos.X + Size.X/2\n    local Y = Pos.Y + Size.Y/2\n    VirtualInputManager:SendMouseButtonEvent(X, Y, 0, true, game, 0)\n    VirtualInputManager:SendMouseButtonEvent(X, Y, 0, false, game, 0)\nend\n\nwhile task.wait() do\n    if AtmGui and AtmGui.Sequence1.Text ~= \"\" then\n        local Codes = GetCodes()\n        for _, Button in ipairs(AtmGui.List:GetDescendants()) do\n            if Button:IsA(\"ImageButton\") and not ClickedButtons[Button] and Button.ImageColor3 ~= BlockedColor then\n                for _, Label in ipairs(Button:GetDescendants()) do\n                    if Label:IsA(\"TextLabel\") then\n                        for _, Code in ipairs(Codes) do\n                            if Label.Text == Code then\n                                ClickButton(Button)\n                                ClickedButtons[Button] = true\n                                break\n                            end\n                        end\n                    end\n                    if ClickedButtons[Button] then break end\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend","features":"🔓 Auto ATM Hack Feature – Description\n\nAuto ATM Hack is an automated feature that completes the ATM hacking minigame for the player without manual input. Once the ATM hacking UI appears, the system instantly detects the required code sequence and clicks the correct buttons automatically.\n\n⚙️ How It Works\n\nDetects when the ATM hacking GUI becomes visible.\n\nReads the required code sequence displayed on the screen.\n\nScans all available ATM buttons.\n\nMatches button labels with the required codes.\n\nAutomatically clicks the correct buttons in the proper order.\n\nSkips blocked or already-used buttons to prevent mistakes.\n\nEnsures each button is only clicked once per sequence.\n\n🚀 Key Benefits\n\nFast & efficient – completes hacks instantly.\n\nHands-free – no need to manually solve the minigame.\n\nAccurate – avoids blocked or incorrect buttons.\n\nFully automatic – runs continuously while the ATM UI is active.\n\n🧠 Smart Behavior\n\nUses real mouse input simulation for reliability.\n\nTracks clicked buttons to prevent duplicate presses.\n\nReacts dynamically to changing code sequences.\n\n🎯 Use Case\n\nIdeal for players who want to:\n\nSave time during ATM robberies\n\nFarm money more efficiently\n\nAvoid failing hacking minigames","tags":["sanaurie","erlc","roleplay"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a","username":"AnynomousScripter","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8befd038d9a677f0a7a2bd87f7dfcd2710ed46e019d1f174b0e03abe07009c96.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a-1761402088532.png"},"status":"offline","id":"68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8befd038d9a677f0a7a2bd87f7dfcd2710ed46e019d1f174b0e03abe07009c96.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a-1761402088532.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T02:43:18.419Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69690fd9f87102127f39864e","editBy":{"_id":"68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a","username":"AnynomousScripter","status":"offline","id":"68fcdc3938f78fe601c8f01a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-01-15T16:03:37.418Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"696f831c1cb26af71bd82c74","commentBy":{"_id":"669553666e133fb69b696725","username":"Kobe1","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.k